			"notes": "## Overview\n\n  `v26.2-rc` is the release candidate after `v26.2-beta`, focused on world-generation and gameplay fixes, plus stability improvements for remote access and enhanced furnaces.\n\n  ## Fixes\n\n  - Fixed `Town of Fortune` generation ignoring its biome restrictions.\n  - Aligned the `Ore Continent` generator's minimum Y level with the dimension height.\n  - Fixed `Universe Guardian` failing to follow its owner across dimensions.\n  - Prevented a division-by-zero case when `Universe Guardian` uses its sonic boom at zero distance.\n  - Fixed remote chunks remaining loaded when a `Universe Console` interaction opens no menu.\n  - Allowed an existing `Universe Teleport Point` destination to be overwritten when its destination list is full.\n  - Prevented fuel duration overflow in the `Supreme Furnace` and `Universe Refinery`.\n\n  ## Compatibility\n\n  - Minecraft `26.2`\n  - Fabric Loader `0.19.3+`\n  - Java `25+`\n\n  ## Compare\n\n  [v26.2-beta...v26.2-rc](https://github.com/roeyqian/Magnatour/compare/v26.2-beta...v26.2-rc)"
		},
