			"notes": "## Overview\n\n  `v26.2-beta` is the next pre-release after `v26.1.2-r1`. It ports Magnatour to Minecraft `26.2` and introduces major world-generation, structure, and endgame exploration updates.\n\n  ## Changes\n\n  - Added `Universe Meta`, a new void-based Universe dimension.\n    - Its first generation creates a persistent 64×64×64 solid cube at the origin, built from `Death Blocks` with reinforced `Rebirth Block` borders.\n    - Added an End-Portal-style `Universe Meta Portal`: activate the 12 non-corner blocks of a 5×5 `Universe Block` frame to create its 3×3 portal center.\n    - Portals support linked Overworld and Universe Meta destinations, safe return-portal creation, and persistent links after server restarts.\n    - Survival players teleport after 80 game ticks in the portal; Creative players teleport instantly.\n    - Added the `Universe Meta` advancement and related models, textures, and localizations.\n  - Reworked `Harvest Continent` terrain generation.\n    - Improved large-scale biome layout and terrain blending around Great Lakes.\n    - Prevented small fragmented micro-biomes and smoothed biome boundaries.\n    - Increased farm-animal replenishment in the dimension.\n  - Added custom `Ore Continent` generation with `Ore Land` and `Ore Forest` biomes, ore-tree features, and adjusted structure generation balance.\n  - Added `Town of Fortune`, including settlement generation, villagers, and livestock replenishment.\n  - Refined `Diamond City` and `Gold Bell Tower` generation, lighting, chain connections, clock presentation, and structure mob spawning.\n  - Refreshed the `Item Hub` presentation and several item textures.\n\n  ## Internal\n\n  - Reorganized registry, networking, world-generation, renderer, screen, and mixin-helper code to support the new content and improve maintainability.\n  - Updated the mod environment and build configuration for Minecraft `26.2`, including Fabric API and Fabric Loom updates.\n\n  ## Compatibility\n\n  - Minecraft `26.2`\n  - Fabric Loader `0.19.3+`\n  - Java `25+`\n\n  ## Compare\n\n  https://github.com/roeyqian/Magnatour/compare/v26.1.2-r1...v26.2-beta"
		},
